.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt LOGIN 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm login
.Nd verify the root password and print the login message
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar user
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is started by
.Xr getty 1
after the login name has been read.
It prompts for a password on
.Pa tty:console
with terminal echo disabled, reads
.Pa /etc/shadow
and verifies the nine-field
.Dv root
record through
.Xr raven-auth 3 .
Only the
.Dv root
account is accepted.
.Pp
On success
.Nm
prints
.Pa /etc/motd
and exits with status 0.
.Xr getty 1
then starts the session shell named by the root entry in
.Pa /etc/passwd .
On failure
.Nm
prints
.Dq Li "Login incorrect"
and exits with status 1.
.Pp
There is no setuid bit, no plaintext password file and no shell expansion in the account files.
The password hash is SHA-512-crypt
.Pq Dq Li "$6$"
from the vetted
.Xr sha-crypt 3
Rust crate; the hash is generated at build time from the release password.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/etc/shadow" -compact
.It Pa /etc/passwd
root account, home and session shell
.It Pa /etc/shadow
root password hash
.It Pa /etc/motd
message printed after a successful login
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr getty 1 ,
.Xr rsh 1 ,
.Xr consd 8
